    },
    "A health app built on Apple Health. Everything stays on this device: your history, your nights, your numbers. Nothing is uploaded. %@ is an independent, experimental project." : {
      "comment" : "A paragraph of text that describes the app, its privacy policy, and its disclaimer.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una app de salud construida sobre Apple Salud. Todo se queda en este dispositivo: tu historial, tus noches, tus números. Nada se sube. %@ es un proyecto independiente y experimental."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A higher VO₂max is associated with a lower risk of all-cause mortality. It's one of the best-evidenced predictors of long-term health." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
