    },
    "A short system tone next to the haptic, for a rest counted by the clock. It follows your ring switch, and it only sounds with the app on screen: if the iPhone locked, there's no sound." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un tono corto del sistema junto a la háptica, para el descanso que cuenta el reloj. Obedece a tu switch de silencio y solo suena con la app en pantalla: si el iPhone se bloqueó, no suena."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A single one can be the room, the blanket, or the night. The guardian waits." : {
