    "Both signals are read from your Apple Watch while you sleep and compared against your own pattern from recent weeks, not population tables. An isolated deviation is ignored on purpose: a warm room or an extra blanket can produce it alone." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Both signals are read from your Apple Watch while you sleep and compared against your own pattern from recent weeks, not population tables. An isolated deviation is ignored on purpose: a warm room or an extra blanket can produce it alone."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las dos señales se leen de tu Apple Watch mientras duermes y se comparan contra tu propio patrón de las últimas semanas, no contra tablas de población. Una desviación aislada se ignora a propósito: un cuarto caliente o una cobija de más la producen solas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
