    "Cénit reads your blood oxygen from Apple Health; the Apple Watch senses it optically at the wrist. A healthy adult typically sits at 95–100%; readings below 90% are considered low (hypoxemia). Isolated low nights are usually noise, altitude, a cold, or how the sensor sat. A sustained run of low nights is what's worth a look with a finger pulse oximeter." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cénit reads your blood oxygen from Apple Health; the Apple Watch senses it optically at the wrist. A healthy adult typically sits at 95–100%; readings below 90% are considered low (hypoxemia). Isolated low nights are usually noise, altitude, a cold, or how the sensor sat. A sustained run of low nights is what's worth a look with a finger pulse oximeter."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cénit lee tu oxígeno en sangre desde Apple Salud; el Apple Watch lo detecta ópticamente en la muñeca. Un adulto sano normalmente está en 95–100%; lecturas por debajo de 90% se consideran bajas (hipoxemia). Las noches bajas aisladas suelen ser ruido, altitud, un resfriado, o cómo quedó el sensor. Lo que vale la pena revisar con un oxímetro de dedo es una racha sostenida de noches bajas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cénit reads your recovery, sleep and strain and keeps them only on your iPhone. No account, no servers. Give it a few days of data and you'll start to see your patterns." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cénit reads your recovery, sleep and strain and keeps them only on your iPhone. No account, no servers. Give it a few days of data and you'll start to see your patterns."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cénit lee tu recuperación, sueño y esfuerzo y los guarda solo en tu iPhone. Sin cuenta, sin servidores. Dale unos días de datos y empezarás a ver tus patrones."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cénit reads your sleep, steps, workouts, weight and heart rate from Apple Health to give you an honest read of your body." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cénit reads your sleep, steps, workouts, weight and heart rate from Apple Health to give you an honest read of your body."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cénit lee tu sueño, pasos, entrenamientos, peso y frecuencia cardiaca desde Apple Salud para darte una lectura honesta de tu cuerpo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cénit works it out on your phone from your heart rate through the day: each second is placed in a zone (1–5) and the total is compressed onto a 0–21 scale." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cénit works it out on your phone from your heart rate through the day: each second is placed in a zone (1–5) and the total is compressed onto a 0–21 scale."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cénit lo calcula en tu teléfono a partir de tu frecuencia cardiaca del día: cada segundo se asigna a una zona (1–5) y el total se comprime a una escala de 0 a 21."
          }
        }
      }
    },
