    "Daily step count. Consistent activity, even a 30-minute walk, supports cardiovascular health and mood. It's context for your day: it doesn't move your daily verdict or your load balance." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Daily step count. Consistent activity, even a 30-minute walk, supports cardiovascular health and mood. It's context for your day: it doesn't move your daily verdict or your load balance."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
