    "HRV (how your heart's timing varied overnight) carries the most weight, because it's the earliest sign of how recovered you are." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV (how your heart's timing varied overnight) carries the most weight, because it's the earliest sign of how recovered you are."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La VFC (cómo varió el ritmo de tu corazón durante la noche) es la que más pesa, porque es la señal más temprana de qué tan recuperado estás."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV and breathing are shown for context but don't vote here. Apple's all-day HRV is too noisy to trust, and breathing is watched by the sentinel alongside your temperature." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV and breathing are shown for context but don't vote here. Apple's all-day HRV is too noisy to trust, and breathing is watched by the sentinel alongside your temperature."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La VFC y la respiración se muestran como contexto, pero aquí no votan: la VFC de todo el día de Apple es demasiado ruidosa para confiar en ella, y la respiración la vigila el centinela junto con tu temperatura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV estimated from Apple Health" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV estimated from Apple Health"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VFC estimada de Apple Salud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV has dropped well below your baseline, pointing to elevated stress or fatigue. Ease off and give your body time to recover." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV has dropped well below your baseline, pointing to elevated stress or fatigue. Ease off and give your body time to recover."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La VFC cayó muy por debajo de tu línea base, lo que apunta a estrés o fatiga elevados. Baja el ritmo y dale a tu cuerpo tiempo de recuperarse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV history" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV history"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
