            "value" : "Historial de VFC"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV is a little low" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV is a little low"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "la VFC está un poco baja"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV is above baseline, a sign of a relaxed, well-recovered nervous system. Stress is low." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV is above baseline, a sign of a relaxed, well-recovered nervous system. Stress is low."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La VFC está por encima de tu línea base, señal de un sistema nervioso relajado y bien recuperado. El estrés es bajo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV is how much the time between your heartbeats varies, in milliseconds, while you sleep. More variation usually means a nervous system that's better rested. What matters isn't the number itself, but how it compares with your own average." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV is how much the time between your heartbeats varies, in milliseconds, while you sleep. More variation usually means a nervous system that's better rested. What matters isn't the number itself, but how it compares with your own average."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La VFC es cuánto varía el tiempo entre tus latidos, en milisegundos, mientras duermes. Más variación suele indicar un sistema nervioso más descansado. Lo que importa no es el número en sí, sino cómo se compara con tu propio promedio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV is personal. There are no universal good/bad thresholds: only your trend over time." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV is personal. There are no universal good/bad thresholds: only your trend over time."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La VFC es personal. No hay umbrales universales de bueno o malo, solo tu tendencia en el tiempo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV joins your resting heart rate as a second, lighter signal on the nights that come in dense: at least 60 clean beats and 30 successive pairs. It is a tuning, not a requirement, and it never speaks on its own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV joins your resting heart rate as a second, lighter signal on the nights that come in dense: at least 60 clean beats and 30 successive pairs. It is a tuning, not a requirement, and it never speaks on its own."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La HRV entra junto a tu frecuencia cardiaca en reposo como un segundo dato, más ligero, en las noches que llegan densas: al menos 60 latidos limpios y 30 pares seguidos. Es una afinación, no un requisito, y nunca opina sola."
          }
        }
      }
    },
