          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you turn it on there, your Apple Watch measures your heartbeat beat by beat far more often while you sleep. That density is what my nightly HRV reading needs. The morning verdict rides on your resting heart rate, with it or without it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you turn it on there, your Apple Watch measures your heartbeat beat by beat far more often while you sleep. That density is what my nightly HRV reading needs. The morning verdict rides on your resting heart rate, with it or without it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si lo enciendes ahí, tu Apple Watch mide tu latido a latido mucho más seguido mientras duermes. Esa densidad es la que necesita mi lectura de HRV nocturna. El veredicto de la mañana se sostiene en tu frecuencia cardiaca en reposo, con esto o sin esto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you turn on AFib History in the Health app, your watch samples your heartbeats much more often and the night read gets sharper." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
