            "value" : "Carga"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Load = sets that touch the muscle × how much it weighs in each exercise (primary 1, secondary ½) × time: every 2 days it's worth half. Fresh and loaded are compared against your most-loaded muscle, not a table. Sets = work sets from the last 7 days; 10–20 is a guide, not a target. You decide." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Carga = series que tocan el músculo × cuánto pesa en cada ejercicio (principal 1, secundaria ½) × tiempo: cada 2 días vale la mitad. «Fresco» y «cargado» se comparan contra tu músculo más cargado, no contra una tabla. Series = series de trabajo de los últimos 7 días; 10–20 es guía, no meta. Tú decides."
          }
        }
      }
    },
