      }
    },
    "One of your steadiest signals. A rise above your own normal can be an early sign that something is taxing you." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One of your steadiest signals. A rise above your own normal can be an early sign that something is taxing you."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De tus señales más estables. Una subida sobre tu propio normal puede ser señal temprana de que algo te está exigiendo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One reminder on each day your plan assigns a routine, at the time you pick. I freeze it when I schedule it: I name the routine, never how you'll be feeling that day." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One reminder on each day your plan assigns a routine, at the time you pick. I freeze it when I schedule it: I name the routine, never how you'll be feeling that day."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un aviso cada día que tu plan te asigna una rutina, a la hora que elijas. Lo congelo al programarlo: nombro la rutina, nunca cómo te vas a sentir ese día."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One signal off your pattern never changes your verdict: a warm room or an extra blanket can move it on its own. Only when both move out together, two days in a row, does the guardian push your day to a lighter one. It never diagnoses anything." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One signal off your pattern never changes your verdict: a warm room or an extra blanket can move it on its own. Only when both move out together, two days in a row, does the guardian push your day to a lighter one. It never diagnoses anything."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una sola señal fuera de tu patrón nunca cambia tu veredicto: un cuarto caliente o una cobija de más la mueven sola. Solo cuando las dos se salen juntas, dos días seguidos, el guardián empuja tu día a uno más leve. Nunca diagnostica nada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
