    },
    "The share of your sleep spent in deep and REM: the stages that physically and mentally restore you. Around 40–50% is typical for a healthy adult." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The share of your sleep spent in deep and REM: the stages that physically and mentally restore you. Around 40–50% is typical for a healthy adult."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La parte de tu sueño en profundo y REM, las etapas que te restauran física y mentalmente. Cerca del 40–50% es lo típico en un adulto sano."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The small number is the change vs yesterday." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The small number is the change vs yesterday."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El número chico es el cambio frente a ayer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The temperature of your skin, read at your wrist while you sleep. It shifts with your circadian rhythm. What matters isn't the number itself, but how far it sits from your own baseline. A sustained rise can be an early sign of inflammation or a coming illness; that's why it's one of the signals behind your daily verdict." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The temperature of your skin, read at your wrist while you sleep. It shifts with your circadian rhythm. What matters isn't the number itself, but how far it sits from your own baseline. A sustained rise can be an early sign of inflammation or a coming illness; that's why it's one of the signals behind your daily verdict."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La temperatura de tu piel, medida en la muñeca mientras duermes. Cambia con tu ritmo circadiano. Lo que importa no es el número en sí, sino qué tan lejos queda de tu propia base. Una subida sostenida puede ser una señal temprana de inflamación o de que te estás enfermando; por eso es una de las señales detrás de tu veredicto del día."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The verdict for how you woke up: your signals against your own baseline." : {
