    "There's no data on this iPhone yet. Cénit has no cloud of its own: the only thing I can restore is a backup file that you exported from Cénit and saved yourself, in iCloud Drive or wherever you keep your files. If you don't have one, there's nothing to bring back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "There's no data on this iPhone yet. Cénit has no cloud of its own: the only thing I can restore is a backup file that you exported from Cénit and saved yourself, in iCloud Drive or wherever you keep your files. If you don't have one, there's nothing to bring back."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todavía no hay datos en este iPhone. Cénit no tiene nube propia: lo único que puedo restaurar es un archivo de respaldo que exportaste desde Cénit y guardaste tú, en iCloud Drive o donde guardes tus archivos. Si no tienes uno, no hay nada que traer de vuelta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
