    "To turn it on, Apple asks you to confirm that a doctor diagnosed you with atrial fibrillation. It is not intended for people under 22. And it switches off the real time irregular rhythm notifications: from then on your Apple Watch sends you a weekly summary instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To turn it on, Apple asks you to confirm that a doctor diagnosed you with atrial fibrillation. It is not intended for people under 22. And it switches off the real time irregular rhythm notifications: from then on your Apple Watch sends you a weekly summary instead."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para encenderlo, Apple te pide confirmar que un médico te diagnosticó fibrilación auricular. No está pensado para menores de 22 años. Y apaga los avisos de ritmo irregular en tiempo real: a partir de ahí tu Apple Watch te manda un resumen semanal."
          }
        }
      }
