    "Watching, not voting: breathing and temperature." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watching, not voting: breathing and temperature."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vigilan sin votar: respiración y temperatura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We average your heart rate in 5-minute buckets across the day, from midnight. Your resting heart rate, the low while you sleep, is its own metric. The zones split the day by how hard your heart worked, as a percentage of your estimated maximum heart rate (zone 1 is 50–60%, zone 5 is 90–100%)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We average your heart rate in 5-minute buckets across the day, from midnight. Your resting heart rate, the low while you sleep, is its own metric. The zones split the day by how hard your heart worked, as a percentage of your estimated maximum heart rate (zone 1 is 50–60%, zone 5 is 90–100%)."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Promediamos tu frecuencia cardiaca en tramos de 5 minutos a lo largo del día, desde medianoche. Tu frecuencia en reposo, la más baja mientras duermes, es una métrica aparte. Las zonas dividen el día según qué tan fuerte trabajó tu corazón, como porcentaje de tu frecuencia cardiaca máxima estimada (la zona 1 es 50–60%, la zona 5 es 90–100%)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We can't score your recovery yet. We need at least %lld nights of sleep to learn your baseline; you're at %lld of %lld. We'd rather not show you a made-up number." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We can't score your recovery yet. We need at least %lld nights of sleep to learn your baseline; you're at %lld of %lld. We'd rather not show you a made-up number."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aún no calculamos tu recuperación. Necesitamos al menos %lld noches de sueño para conocer tu línea base; llevas %lld de %lld. Preferimos no darte un número inventado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We compare the median of your Recovery the morning after each sport against your “untouched” rest days (no workouts, and not the days right after a session). The difference is what you see here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We compare the median of your Recovery the morning after each sport against your “untouched” rest days (no workouts, and not the days right after a session). The difference is what you see here."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comparamos la mediana de tu Recuperación la mañana siguiente a cada deporte contra tus días de descanso «intactos» (sin entrenamientos y fuera de los días posteriores a una sesión). La diferencia es lo que ves aquí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We compare today's resting heart rate and HRV with your own 30-day baseline. A higher-than-usual resting HR and a lower-than-usual HRV both push the score up: classic signs the body is activated. The combined shift becomes a z-score sum, squashed onto 0–3 by a logistic curve: 0 calm, 1.5 at your baseline, 3 highly activated." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We compare today's resting heart rate and HRV with your own 30-day baseline. A higher-than-usual resting HR and a lower-than-usual HRV both push the score up: classic signs the body is activated. The combined shift becomes a z-score sum, squashed onto 0–3 by a logistic curve: 0 calm, 1.5 at your baseline, 3 highly activated."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comparamos tu FC en reposo y tu VFC de hoy con tu propia base de 30 días. Una FC en reposo más alta de lo habitual y una VFC más baja empujan el índice hacia arriba: señales clásicas de activación. El desvío combinado se convierte en una suma de z-scores y se comprime a 0–3 con una curva logística: 0 calma, 1.5 en tu base, 3 muy activado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We compare your average strain over the last ~7 days against your last ~28. 1.0 means you trained about your usual; 0.8 to 1.3 reads as balance. It's context for your recovery, not an injury prediction." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We compare your average strain over the last ~7 days against your last ~28. 1.0 means you trained about your usual; 0.8 to 1.3 reads as balance. It's context for your recovery, not an injury prediction."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comparamos tu esfuerzo promedio de los últimos ~7 días contra tus últimos ~28. 1.0 significa que entrenaste más o menos lo habitual; 0.8 a 1.3 se lee como equilibrio. Es contexto para tu recuperación, no predice lesiones."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We compare your days with and without each habit you log. If the difference is real in your numbers, it shows up here as a lever.\n\nThey're candidates until an experiment proves them. Everything is computed on your phone." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comparamos tus días con y sin cada hábito que anotas. Si la diferencia es real en tus números, aparece aquí como una palanca.\n\nSon candidatos hasta que un experimento los pruebe. Todo se calcula en tu teléfono."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We couldn't read that as a plan file. Paste the full result your AI gave you, or upload the .json." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We couldn't read that as a plan file. Paste the full result your AI gave you, or upload the .json."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No pudimos leer eso como un archivo de plan. Pega el resultado completo que te dio tu IA, o sube el .json."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We count your breaths across the night from the slow rise and fall in your heart-rate signal (respiratory sinus arrhythmia) and report the nightly mean." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We count your breaths across the night from the slow rise and fall in your heart-rate signal (respiratory sinus arrhythmia) and report the nightly mean."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Contamos tus respiraciones a lo largo de la noche a partir del sube y baja lento de tu frecuencia cardiaca (arritmia sinusal respiratoria) y reportamos la media de la noche."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We didn't count your %@ nap, regularity uses only your main night." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We didn't count your %@ nap, regularity uses only your main night."
