            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu frecuencia cardíaca a lo largo del día, promediada en intervalos de 5 minutos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your heart rate across the day, in 5-minute averages. Your resting heart rate, the low while you sleep, is its own metric." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your heart rate across the day, in 5-minute averages. Your resting heart rate, the low while you sleep, is its own metric."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu frecuencia cardiaca a lo largo del día, en promedios de 5 minutos. Tu frecuencia en reposo, la más baja mientras duermes, es una métrica aparte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your heart rate when your body is fully at rest: how hard your heart has to work doing nothing. Lower generally means a stronger, more efficient cardiovascular system. Cénit reads it against your own norm as part of your daily verdict; a rise can signal fatigue or that something's coming on." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your heart rate when your body is fully at rest: how hard your heart has to work doing nothing. Lower generally means a stronger, more efficient cardiovascular system. Cénit reads it against your own norm as part of your daily verdict; a rise can signal fatigue or that something's coming on."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu frecuencia cardíaca cuando tu cuerpo está en reposo total: lo que le cuesta latir sin hacer nada. Más baja suele indicar un sistema cardiovascular más fuerte y eficiente. Cénit la compara con tu propia norma como parte de tu veredicto del día; una subida puede señalar fatiga o que algo se está gestando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
