          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu Recuperación del día siguiente casi no se mueve tras los deportes que alcanzamos a ver."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your night moves through four phases. The watch estimates them from your movement and heart rate, so they're approximate: it gets about 2 of 3 right." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your night moves through four phases. The watch estimates them from your movement and heart rate, so they're approximate: it gets about 2 of 3 right."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu noche pasa por cuatro fases. El reloj las estima con tu movimiento y tu ritmo cardiaco, así que son aproximadas: acierta cerca de 2 de cada 3."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your night-time temperature doesn't show a rhythm I can read with confidence. This is common and doesn't mean anything is wrong with you or your Apple Watch. I'll keep watching in case it appears." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu temperatura nocturna no muestra un ritmo que pueda leer con confianza. Es algo común y no significa que algo ande mal contigo ni con tu Apple Watch. Sigo observando por si aparece."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your nightly skin temperature and breathing, watched against your own pattern." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your nightly skin temperature and breathing, watched against your own pattern."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu temperatura de piel y tu respiración de la noche, vigiladas contra tu propio patrón."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your nightly warming into sleep swings a fair amount night-to-night. A steadier wind-down tends to settle it. An association, not a full 24-hour rhythm." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your nightly warming into sleep swings a fair amount night-to-night. A steadier wind-down tends to settle it. An association, not a full 24-hour rhythm."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu calentamiento nocturno al dormir oscila bastante noche a noche. Un cierre del día más estable suele asentarlo. Una asociación, no un ritmo completo de 24 horas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your nightly warming into sleep varies a moderate amount night-to-night. An association, not a full 24-hour rhythm." : {
